  "about_item": [
    "Adjustable Dog Muzzle: Dual-adjustable straps (snout & neck) with a secure neck connection keep the muzzle snug and anti-slip. The adjustable design ensures a tailored fit that’s tight enough to prevent biting while staying comfortable for your pet. Important Measuring Tip: Follow the picture guide—measure the tip of your dog’s snout, not the widest part, for a perfect fit.",
    "Comfortable & Breathable: Crafted with high-quality nylon, soft breathable mesh, and skin-friendly fabric, this dog muzzle is both practical and durable. Extra soft padding lines the interior, delivering ultimate comfort for your pet even during extended wear. The breathable structure allows for smooth airflow, avoiding stuffiness.",
    "Upgraded Human Design: Unlike traditional muzzles that restrict basic needs, our humane design leaves ample space for your dog to breathe, pant, and drink water freely. It effectively prevents biting while enabling safe socialization with other pets and people—striking the perfect balance between safety and comfort.",
    "Easy to Wear & Clean: Ergonomic design ensures a secure fit that stays in place. Features a strong hook-and-loop fastener for quick, hassle-free wearing (no loose ends!). Note: Most dogs need a short adaptation period—please introduce the muzzle patiently. Machine-washable and designed to dry flat, it’s effortless to keep clean and fresh.",
    "Multiple Size Options: PAWsay Dog Mesh Muzzle comes in 5 sizes to fit most dog breeds—find your pet’s perfect match! The L size (ideal for snout circumferences 7.8\"-9\") works great for Large breeds like Labrador Retriever, Golden Retriever etc. Don't choose size based on breed, weight, or previous size. Be sure to measure and follow the size chart before purchasing. Your dog's snout circumference should fall within the size chart when you're choosing"
  ],
