        "position": 3,
        "title": "Glad I picked up this 2 back! A great deal.",
        "text": "This 2-pack dog muzzle has been an absolute game changer for me and my dog. He barks every time he goes outside and tends to make poor choices on walks by trying to eat anything he comes across, so this has really helped keep things under control. My neighbors definitely appreciate it too!What I love most is how lightweight and comfortable these muzzles are. The mesh material is soft and breathable, so it doesn’t irritate my dog at all, even on hot days. He seems much more comfortable wearing this compared to other muzzles I’ve tried and the advertised sizing was spot on.The value is fantastic as well. Getting a 2-pack is perfect because I know eventually one will get misplaced or lost. They’re easy to put on, well-made, and seem very durable even with regular use. The stitching and materials feel solid, especially for the price.Overall, this is a great product at a great price, and I honestly wish I had picked one up much earlier. Highly recommended!",
        "rating": 5,
