      {
        "position": 4,
        "title": "These have been wonderful for my reactive dog",
        "text": "The LETSQK 2 Pack Soft Mesh Dog Muzzle is exactly what I hoped it would be: a breathable, secure muzzle to prevent my reactive dog from biting when out of the comfort of her home. I received the size Large muzzle for my 125lb Doberman Shepherd. The mesh muzzle sits comfortable on her snout and adjusts behind the ears at the back of her head. There is a sliding lock mechanism on the buckle that goes behind the head to prevent any accidental removal. Also, there is Velcro adjustments around the mesh snout area to provide a custom, snug fit on your pup. It is also very easy to put on and take off. It’s not my dog’s favorite thing to wear, but once we get going and stop focusing on the muzzle, she forgets she has it on. She is able to drink and eat reward treats with it on as well. The stitching is well done with no fraying or loose stitching. The fabric is a solid quality as well and easy to clean if it gets dirty. I love that this came in a two pack so I can keep one at home and one in the car. The two pack definitely makes it a good value too. I do recommend measuring your pups snout appropriately before ordering so that you truly get the proper size and fit. Overall, I do recommend the LETSQK 2 Pack Soft Mesh Dog Muzzle. They have been a huge help with my reactive dog.",
