        "title": "Great for pups with lean snouts",
        "text": "Animal shelter volunteer here! These muzzles have worked really well for us, especially during vaccinations and routine handling for nervous or wiggly pups. They’re particularly good for breeds with longer, thinner snouts like Jack Russells, where a lot of standard muzzles tend to fit awkwardly or slip around.The soft mesh material is lightweight and breathable, so the dogs can still pant comfortably while being safely restrained for quick procedures. The adjustable straps make it easy to get a secure fit fast, which is important when working with multiple dogs throughout the day. We also like having the 2-pack on hand since it’s convenient to rotate between cleanings. Overall, a simple, effective option for short-term shelter and vet use.",
